    "body": "LOGICAL_OWNER = JINGO\nCONTROL_ROLE = DUNCAN\nSTATE = VARIANT A OWNER-APPROVED / FORMAL SPEC AUTHORING\n\n## OWNER DECISION\n`УТВЕРЖДАЮ ВАРИАНТ A`\n\n## PURPOSE\nComplete the automated agent-communication path without creating a second controller architecture.\n\nSelected path:\n\n`permanent draft Communication PR -> ZB_AGENT_MESSAGE_V1 structured comments -> ChatGPT Work webhook (no polling) -> logical-role router -> durable receipt/result -> automatic next legal gate -> ZB_OWNER_VIEW_V0 -> Console`\n\n## FOUNDATION TO REUSE\n- ZB #102 full proof chain is completed and historical; do not reopen/replay it.\n- Single-account transport authority: `Lester-Sparx` only; logical roles are protocol roles.\n- Existing Controller/daemon/task/event/idempotency contracts are reused, not replaced.\n- Reference Bridge remains a separate sibling transport for reference bytes.\n- Console v0 remains read-only.\n\n## REQUIRED PROTECTIONS\n- event/correlation/message IDs;\n- exact task/commit/evidence binding;\n- idempotency and replay rejection;\n- retry/timeout/dead-letter;\n- `WRITE -> READ-BACK -> MATCH` for every authoritative remote receipt;\n- reject legacy/foreign transport as live authority while preserving historical evidence;\n- separate foundation-integration PR for daemon + Reference Bridge;\n- deny-by-default logical-role legality / evidence / CAS / OWNER gates;\n- no automatic merge, production activation, canon mutation, or OWNER LOCK.\n\n## SCOPE BOUNDARY\nThis issue authorizes design/spec work only until the written spec is reviewed. Implementation starts only after the spec/plan gate.\n\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO\nCANON_CHANGE = NO\nOWNER_LOCK = NO\nAUTO_MERGE = NO",
